Audio Duration: 5m 15.5s (315.51s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 11:45:12 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 0.98)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:01,800] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 7  | Text: 我一直在思考一個問題
Segment #2   [00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,340] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 就是在我年輕的時候
Segment #3   [00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,840] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 剛踏入社會的那個階段
Segment #4   [00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:08,060] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 11 | Text: 走了他媽太多太多的玩弄了
Segment #5   [00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,900] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 8  | Text: 也浪費了特別多的時間
Segment #6   [00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,160] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 10 | Text: 如果說你還在20幾歲以後
Segment #7   [00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:13,940] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 4  | Text: 希望你停下來
Segment #8   [00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,640] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 10 | Text: 來認真地聽我幾句懺悔
Segment #9   [00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,580] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 這也就是到後期
Segment #10  [00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,460] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 真正能夠脫了一層皮
Segment #11  [00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,680] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 才能想明白的東西
Segment #12  [00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:25,860] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 6  | Text: 但是時間沒有倒流了
Segment #13  [00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,460] | Elapsed:  11.74s | Words: 9  | Text: 話又重開著人物在上面
Segment #14  [00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,800] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 20到30歲
Segment #15  [00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,980] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 是每個人人生當中最寶貴的
Segment #16  [00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:33,780] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 黃金年齡
Segment #17  [00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,420] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果說要在這一個時間段裏
Segment #18  [00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,480] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 愛情和事業
Segment #19  [00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:40,080] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 必須要選一樣的話
Segment #20  [00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,000] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 我可以很負責任地告訴你
Segment #21  [00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,020] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 選事業
Segment #22  [00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:44,120] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 因為只有賺錢
Segment #23  [00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,880] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 10 | Text: 才是我們男人應該掌握的東西
Segment #24  [00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,160] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 沒有金錢的男人
Segment #25  [00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,560] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 12 | Text: 就像被出了脊椎的軟體動力
Segment #26  [00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,100] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 永遠太不起頭了
Segment #27  [00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:52,620] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 吃不起腰
Segment #28  [00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:55,380] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 其實20到30歲
Segment #29  [00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:56,580] | Elapsed:  25.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 這個黃金年齡段
Segment #30  [00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,160] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 也是人生經歷最旺盛的
Segment #31  [00:00:59,160 --> 00:01:00,680] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 可塑性最強的年齡段
Segment #32  [00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:02,720] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 所以一定要遠離那些
Segment #33  [00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,160] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 5  | Text: 能讓我們獲得
Segment #34  [00:01:04,160 --> 00:01:06,340] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 短暫的短期快樂的事情
Segment #35  [00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:07,480] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 比方說打個遊戲
Segment #36  [00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,780] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 上個酒吧
Segment #37  [00:01:09,300 --> 00:01:11,340] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 和那些同學好朋友在一起
Segment #38  [00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:13,340] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 風華雪月最深夢似的
Segment #39  [00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:15,760] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 10 | Text: 這種是絕對沒有任何意義的
Segment #40  [00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:17,560] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 11 | Text: 它對你提供不了任何的幫助
Segment #41  [00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:19,780] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 11 | Text: 而且也會把你整個人都高飛掉
Segment #42  [00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:21,440] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 6  | Text: 一定要把大部分的時間
Segment #43  [00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:23,620] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 9  | Text: 都花在學習和賺錢上面
Segment #44  [00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,280] | Elapsed:  41.76s | Words: 4  | Text: 時間很快的
Segment #45  [00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:28,180] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 就和那個風一吹
Segment #46  [00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:28,960] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 3  | Text: 這樣行嗎
Segment #47  [00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,660] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 風一吹什麼都不剩
Segment #48  [00:01:31,260 --> 00:01:33,040] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 你比如說十年二十年了
Segment #49  [00:01:33,040 --> 00:01:34,360] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 有可能時間過的
Segment #50  [00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,920] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 9  | Text: 都比你想像的快太多了
Segment #51  [00:01:36,620 --> 00:01:37,900] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 我就以十年為週期
Segment #52  [00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,180] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 你去看看身邊
Segment #53  [00:01:39,180 --> 00:01:41,080] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 和我們和自己的身邊人
Segment #54  [00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:41,800] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 去做對比
Segment #55  [00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:43,360] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 8  | Text: 人與人之間的差距
Segment #56  [00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:44,500] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 就在這十年裡
Segment #57  [00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,460] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 2  | Text: 有的時候
Segment #58  [00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,240] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 6  | Text: 我感覺我這發洩
Segment #59  [00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:48,640] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 7  | Text: 好幾年沒聯繫了
Segment #60  [00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,420] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 4  | Text: 在一見面
Segment #61  [00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:51,300] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 5  | Text: 差距太大了
Segment #62  [00:01:51,300 --> 00:01:53,440] | Elapsed:  56.81s | Words: 10 | Text: 還有就是不要把感情看得太重
Segment #63  [00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:55,700] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 8  | Text: 就在我年紀比較輕的時候
Segment #64  [00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:57,620] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 我也會把感情
Segment #65  [00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,440] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 放在第一位
Segment #66  [00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,940] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 6  | Text: 重到什麼程度呢
Segment #67  [00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:02,900] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 我可以什麼都沒有
Segment #68  [00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,440] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 我不要能失去對方
Segment #69  [00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,400] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是到有一天
Segment #70  [00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,580] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 你們會過了
Segment #71  [00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:09,000] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 7  | Text: 微信索坑的年紀
Segment #72  [00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,620] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 踏上拼命掙錢的旅途
Segment #73  [00:02:11,620 --> 00:02:13,000] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 這個時候就會發現
Segment #74  [00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:15,420] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 什麼男婚女愛
Segment #75  [00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:16,040] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 3  | Text: 親了愛
Segment #76  [00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,700] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 5  | Text: 有錢了什麼都有
Segment #77  [00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,580] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 9  | Text: 如果說你們還在二十多歲
Segment #78  [00:02:20,580 --> 00:02:21,920] | Elapsed:  71.02s | Words: 4  | Text: 可以享受生活
Segment #79  [00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,700] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是必須要學會存錢
Segment #80  [00:02:24,100 --> 00:02:24,980] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 無論今天
Segment #81  [00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:25,880] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 你的收入
Segment #82  [00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,260] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的工資有多少
Segment #83  [00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,460] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 你有沒有結婚
Segment #84  [00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:29,200] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 2  | Text: 有沒有孩子
Segment #85  [00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,380] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 都要保證自己
Segment #86  [00:02:30,380 --> 00:02:31,680] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 在三個月的時間裡面
Segment #87  [00:02:32,420 --> 00:02:33,300] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 我哪怕就是
Segment #88  [00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:34,480] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 沒有任何的收入
Segment #89  [00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:36,220] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 6  | Text: 我也可以很體面地
Segment #90  [00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:36,840] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 去活下去
Segment #91  [00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:37,960] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 我不需要去
Segment #92  [00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,780] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 被動不耐地
Segment #93  [00:02:38,780 --> 00:02:39,460] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 3  | Text: 去做一些
Segment #94  [00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:41,660] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 7  | Text: 身不由己的選擇
Segment #95  [00:02:41,660 --> 00:02:42,640] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 2  | Text: 明白嗎
Segment #96  [00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,220] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 因為你沒有錢
Segment #97  [00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:45,000] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 2  | Text: 沒有錢
Segment #98  [00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:45,560] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 就意味著
Segment #99  [00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,600] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 5  | Text: 你沒有主動權
Segment #100 [00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:47,580] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 4  | Text: 更意味著
Segment #101 [00:02:47,580 --> 00:02:49,420] | Elapsed:  86.57s | Words: 9  | Text: 你連選擇生活的自由都沒有
Segment #102 [00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,980] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以說這個才是要真實的
Segment #103 [00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:53,640] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 人一定要學會
Segment #104 [00:02:54,060 --> 00:02:54,940] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 享受孤獨
Segment #105 [00:02:54,940 --> 00:02:55,920] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 2  | Text: 明白嗎
Segment #106 [00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:56,420] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 1  | Text: 真的
Segment #107 [00:02:56,420 --> 00:02:57,180] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 這就是我現在
Segment #108 [00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,700] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 5  | Text: 活了這麼多年
Segment #109 [00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:00,840] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 10 | Text: 我才真正意識到的一個問題
Segment #110 [00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:02,140] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 2  | Text: 有的時候
Segment #111 [00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,900] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 過多的一些人際交往
Segment #112 [00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:06,640] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 6  | Text: 沒有意義的解決
Segment #113 [00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:08,760] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 8  | Text: 沒有毫無關聯的一些人
Segment #114 [00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,740] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 一些不說酒囊飯袋
Segment #115 [00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:11,900] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 這種酒路朋友
Segment #116 [00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:12,720] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 3  | Text: 喝了今天
Segment #117 [00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:13,940] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 今天見完面
Segment #118 [00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:15,040] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 7  | Text: 轉身就有一輩子的
Segment #119 [00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:15,940] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 4  | Text: 沒有下一次的
Segment #120 [00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:18,120] | Elapsed: 101.42s | Words: 9  | Text: 能不聯繫就不聯繫了
Segment #121 [00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,560] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 過多的這種東西
Segment #122 [00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,440] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 3  | Text: 沒有意義
Segment #123 [00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,680] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 給自己一個交代
Segment #124 [00:03:24,840 --> 00:03:26,040] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 定而後能靜
Segment #125 [00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,520] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 靜而才能安
Segment #126 [00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,080] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 1  | Text: 對不對
Segment #127 [00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,460] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 這句話什麼意思呢
Segment #128 [00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,080] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 7  | Text: 只有人選擇獨處的時候
Segment #129 [00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,040] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 5  | Text: 你的心才會靜
Segment #130 [00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:34,160] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 8  | Text: 心靜了你才能想明白
Segment #131 [00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:34,860] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 更多的問題
Segment #132 [00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:35,900] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 也能想明白
Segment #133 [00:03:35,900 --> 00:03:36,560] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 更多的事情
Segment #134 [00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,760] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 視頻的最後
Segment #135 [00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,740] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 6  | Text: 再來個總結吧
Segment #136 [00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:40,900] | Elapsed: 116.64s | Words: 4  | Text: 二十多歲
Segment #137 [00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,160] | Elapsed: 116.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 也是最容易忽略
Segment #138 [00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,200] | Elapsed: 116.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 最容易吃虧的一點
Segment #139 [00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,700] | Elapsed: 116.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是真的不要一開始
Segment #140 [00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:45,700] | Elapsed: 116.65s | Words: 6  | Text: 對別人就太好
Segment #141 [00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,380] | Elapsed: 116.65s | Words: 5  | Text: 人性真的就是這樣
Segment #142 [00:03:47,380 --> 00:03:49,420] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 對孩子很好的父母
Segment #143 [00:03:49,420 --> 00:03:50,980] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 9  | Text: 往往就得不到孩子的尊重
Segment #144 [00:03:50,980 --> 00:03:52,220] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 對自己女朋友
Segment #145 [00:03:52,220 --> 00:03:53,300] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 對自己媳婦
Segment #146 [00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:54,140] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 太好的男人
Segment #147 [00:03:54,140 --> 00:03:55,580] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 往往就變成了
Segment #148 [00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:56,460] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 被拋棄的對象
Segment #149 [00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:58,300] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 你沒有邊界的心軟
Segment #150 [00:03:58,300 --> 00:03:59,140] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 只會讓對方
Segment #151 [00:03:59,140 --> 00:04:00,240] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 覺得你好無底線
Segment #152 [00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,100] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 6  | Text: 好無原則的人詞
Segment #153 [00:04:02,100 --> 00:04:03,000] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 5  | Text: 只會讓對方
Segment #154 [00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,660] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 為所欲為
Segment #155 [00:04:03,660 --> 00:04:03,940] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 1  | Text: 是不是
Segment #156 [00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,060] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 所以說我們一定要保護好
Segment #157 [00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:06,900] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 2  | Text: 自己的
Segment #158 [00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:07,540] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 3  | Text: 不是心臟
Segment #159 [00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:08,900] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 保護好自己的底線
Segment #160 [00:04:08,900 --> 00:04:11,140] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 要守住自己的底線
Segment #161 [00:04:11,140 --> 00:04:13,240] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要去做一個爛好人
Segment #162 [00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,720] | Elapsed: 132.71s | Words: 4  | Text: 以上那些點
Segment #163 [00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:16,000] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是我最近這些年
Segment #164 [00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:18,880] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 11 | Text: 學語慮壞了的經驗和教訓
Segment #165 [00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:21,420] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 希望對你們也有所幫助
Segment #166 [00:04:21,420 --> 00:04:22,320] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 也希望讓你們
Segment #167 [00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:23,980] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 少走一些彎路吧
Segment #168 [00:04:23,980 --> 00:04:26,100] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 因為青春不會重來
Segment #169 [00:04:26,760 --> 00:04:27,820] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 我記得我開篇的時候
Segment #170 [00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:28,580] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 也講過一句
Segment #171 [00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,740] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 2  | Text: 人有
Segment #172 [00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:32,740] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 花有重開
Segment #173 [00:04:32,740 --> 00:04:34,020] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 人無在少年
Segment #174 [00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,220] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 有的東西錯過了
Segment #175 [00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:37,300] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 它真的就錯過了
Segment #176 [00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,460] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果說有一些道理
Segment #177 [00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,060] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 我早一點點能明白
Segment #178 [00:04:40,060 --> 00:04:41,300] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 有可能現在我就
Segment #179 [00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,520] | Elapsed: 147.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 或是另一個不同版本的我
